<title>BOLIVIA: Bolivian June inflation 0.94 percent.</title>
<headline>Bolivian June inflation 0.94 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivian consumer price inflation was 0.94 percent in June, the government's National Institute of Statistics said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Inflation was 0.72 percent in May, and 0.53 percent in June 1996.</p>
<p>Annual inflation was 5.2 percent in June, compared to 12.27 percent in June 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Carlos Quiroga, La Paz Newsroom +5912 39-1366))</p>
